eport with prioritized recommendations.\nKnowledge Gap Mapping\nunder: ns__Strategy\n\n\nserved: ^ns__Actor_XenaGithubber, ^ns__Decision_DiagnosticFirst, ^ns__Decision_KnowledgeMapping\n(pass this list back as `have` on your next expand — content you already hold is then returned as a bare ^pointer, never re-sent)","positions":"","pin":"3f3feac31655363a7346bc2f1e4299a03d334bb5","positions_consult":"{\"positions\":[]}","context_bytes":3101},"live_run_id":"f42053fe00a9","at":"2026-07-20T11:01:41Z"}
